1
00:00:00,467 --> 00:00:04,000
Eight Days Pune, November 2035.

2
00:00:04,467 --> 00:00:10,500
Asha Rao is 34. She has cooked at home all her life. On Monday she starts a trial shift in a restaurant kitchen. She has never held a knife the way chefs do.

3
00:00:12,167 --> 00:00:16,300
Her cousin sends her a link: a skin patch that lets you rent an expert’s hands, by the hour.

4
00:00:16,767 --> 00:00:22,233
It sits on the temple, and reads the signals your brain sends to your muscles.

5
00:00:24,300 --> 00:00:31,500
First, the patch needs a shell. Asha describes hers.

6
00:00:31,967 --> 00:00:38,633
It is printed for her, and she can see it on a model of a head before she pays.

7
00:00:39,700 --> 00:00:43,767
₹48,900 for the patch and her shell. The patch is hers to keep. The skills are not.

8
00:00:44,233 --> 00:00:48,933
She has eight days. She pays extra for a drone drop tomorrow.

9
00:00:50,600 --> 00:00:53,733
Her shell is printed overnight.

10
00:00:54,200 --> 00:00:56,933
The drone lands on the terrace.

11
00:00:58,433 --> 00:01:01,600
She taps her phone on the box lid. The patch knows it is hers.

12
00:01:02,067 --> 00:01:11,833
A small test pulse. A faint tingle. The patch measures how her muscles answer.

13
00:01:13,100 --> 00:01:17,233
Then a surprise. Knack already has a profile of her.

14
00:01:17,700 --> 00:01:20,633
From a phone test, her health record, her smart ring…

15
00:01:21,100 --> 00:01:24,233
…and her new employer, who offers to pay 20% of her plan.

16
00:01:24,700 --> 00:01:30,267
In return, the restaurant will see every hour she streams. Money is tight. She leaves it on.

17
00:01:31,933 --> 00:01:43,300
The vault: skills recorded from real people, who are paid for every minute you use them.

18
00:01:43,767 --> 00:01:51,767
Chef Arjun Mehra. Twenty-two years in commercial kitchens. ₹1,850 an hour.

19
00:01:53,233 --> 00:01:58,700
Her plan is built from her body, not her deadline: short sessions, long rests.

20
00:01:59,167 --> 00:02:07,200
Before she can pay, she has to confirm she knows what streaming does to her.

21
00:02:09,267 --> 00:02:13,233
The safety guide is optional. Nine in ten people skip it. So does Asha.

22
00:02:13,700 --> 00:02:16,633
Her trial shift starts at ten.

23
00:02:20,433 --> 00:02:24,167
For one hour, her hands move like his.

24
00:02:36,433 --> 00:02:40,667
Keeping the 13% that stays would cost ₹60,100.

25
00:02:41,133 --> 00:02:44,200
She lets it fade.

26
00:02:44,667 --> 00:02:51,700
Asha gets the job. Her employer can see every hour she streams. Her own hands, without the patch, are a little less steady than they were a week ago.

27
00:02:52,167 --> 00:02:57,200
Who owns a skill once it has been in your hands?

28
00:02:57,667 --> 00:03:01,700
Get the knack. Not a real product.
